{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/Sci"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A subject that broadcasts its current value and all subsequent values to multiple consumers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can also handle completion events, including normal termination and failure with an error."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s CurrentValueSubject."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CurrentValueSubject"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Subscribing","anchor":"Subscribing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A consumer subscribes when its iterator is created, which is when a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"for try await"},{"type":"text","text":" loop over the subject"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(or over an operator chain built on it) begins. It first receives the value that is current at that moment,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"then every value sent afterwards, in order; values are buffered for it until it consumes them. Values sent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before it subscribed are not replayed. A consumer that subscribes after completion receives only the completion."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To subscribe before the consumer’s task runs, make the iterator now and hand it over as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncIteratorSequence","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Cancelling a task waiting for the next value ends that consumer’s subscription."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let subject = CurrentValueSubject(0)","let subscribed = SingleValueSubject<Void>()","","subject.send(1) \/\/ Becomes the current value; no one is subscribed yet.","","Task {","    for try await value in subject.handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator: { try? subscribed.send() }) {","        print(\"Received value: \\(value)\") \/\/ prints 1, then 2, then 3","    }","}","","try await subscribed.execute()","subject.send(2)","subject.send(3)","subject.send(completion: .finished)"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CurrentValueSubject"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CurrentValueSubject"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"CurrentValueSubject.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject.swift#L38"},"role":"symbol","title":"CurrentValueSubject","externalID":"s:7Afluent19CurrentValueSubjectC","modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/currentvaluesubject"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"